---
description: >-
  Classic-look sequence diagram where participants use the inline
  `@{ "alias": "..." }` metadata object with only the `alias` field set and
  no `type` field, verifying that display-name aliasing works
  independently of the participant-type metadata.
config:
  look: classic
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant API@{ "alias": "Public API" }
  participant Auth@{ "alias": "Auth Service" }
  API ->> Auth: Request
  Auth -->> API: Response
